3. WHAT IS NOT COVERED
================================================================================

Nothing here relicenses third-party data. Provider terms continue to apply to
the raw files that code/01_fetch.py and code/09_fetch_extended.py download, and
those files are not distributed with this repository (see .gitignore):

  - Afrobarometer Round 9 respondent-level data are copyrighted and may not be
    redistributed. The code downloads them from afrobarometer.org; only
    weighted aggregates appear in tables/.
  - The Wittgenstein Centre Human Capital Data Explorer declares no licence.
    Only derived aggregates are published here, with citation.
  - World Bank (WDI, EdStats, HCI), the Maddison Project 2023 and Our World in
    Data's own processing are CC BY 4.0.
  - Barro-Lee v3 states no explicit licence; citation is required.
